  "foaf:name": "Women in blue: gender equity for ocean sustainability",
  "sdo:name": "Women in blue: gender equity for ocean sustainability",
  "sdo:description": "Increasing global threats to the ocean requires sustainable actions. Although women’s knowledge and roles for community well-being and in ocean-related activities are key to sustainability, they often have fewer opportunities, undervalued work positions and lower wages, especially in developing countries. The ‘Women in blue: gender equity for ocean sustainability’ project will foster women&#x27;s empowerment and gender equality in science, fisheries and politics. This will be achieved by: 1)  identifying barriers and solution paths for women participation and leadership in ocean affairs; 2) strengthening the voices of women in fisheries to engage in climate change and policy discussions by facilitating the connection of existing networks across Brazilian coast.",
  "sdo:location": "Brazil",
